---
import PageLayout from '@layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '@/config/site';

const lastUpdated = 'June 16, 2025';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Disclaimer"
  description="Important disclaimers about the educational nature of AstraLumen content. Our science articles and tools are for learning, not professional advice."
  breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Disclaimer' }]}
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="hero-icon" aria-hidden="true">⚠️</span>
      <h1>Disclaimer</h1>
      <p class="hero-meta">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose legal-prose">
      <p>
        Please read this disclaimer carefully before using {SITE.name} ({SITE.url}).
        By accessing and using this website, you acknowledge and agree to the terms below.
      </p>

      <h2>Educational Purpose Only</h2>
      <p>
        All content published on {SITE.name} — including articles, guides, science facts,
        interactive tools, calculators, experiments, and downloadable resources — is provided
        strictly for <strong>general informational and educational purposes</strong>. Nothing
        on this Site constitutes professional, medical, legal, engineering, financial, or
        any other form of specialized advice.
      </p>

      <h2>Not a Substitute for Professional Advice</h2>
      <p>
        The information on this Site should not be used as a substitute for consultation
        with qualified professionals. Always seek the advice of a physician, licensed
        healthcare provider, or other qualified professional with any questions regarding
        a medical condition, health decisions, or treatment. Never disregard professional
        medical advice or delay seeking it because of something you read on {SITE.name}.
      </p>

      <h2>Scientific Accuracy &amp; Currency</h2>
      <p>
        While we make every effort to ensure our content is accurate, current, and aligned
        with scientific consensus, science is an evolving field. Information may become
        outdated as new research emerges. We update articles regularly but cannot guarantee
        that all content reflects the very latest discoveries at all times.
      </p>
      <p>
        We encourage readers to verify important information using primary sources and
        consult our <a href="/editorial-policy">Editorial Policy</a> and cited references
        at the end of each article.
      </p>

      <h2>Interactive Tools &amp; Calculators</h2>
      <p>
        Our science tools — including planet weight calculators, light-year converters, and
        other interactive features — are designed for educational exploration. Results are
        approximations based on published scientific constants and simplified models. They
        should not be used for engineering calculations, navigation, medical dosing, or any
        purpose requiring precision beyond educational demonstration.
      </p>

      <h2>Experiments &amp; Hands-On Activities</h2>
      <p>
        Any experiments or hands-on activities described on this Site should be conducted
        under appropriate adult supervision, especially by minors. {SITE.name} is not
        responsible for injuries, property damage, or other harm resulting from the
        performance of experiments or activities described on the Site. Always follow
        safety guidelines and local regulations.
      </p>

      <h2>External Links</h2>
      <p>
        Our articles may contain links to external websites for additional reading and
        reference. These links are provided for convenience and do not imply endorsement.
        We have no control over the content, accuracy, or privacy practices of third-party
        sites and accept no responsibility for them.
      </p>

      <h2>Advertising</h2>
      <p>
        {SITE.name} may display advertisements through third-party services such as Google
        AdSense. The appearance of advertisements does not constitute an endorsement of
        advertised products or services. We are not responsible for the claims made in
        third-party advertisements.
      </p>

      <h2>No Warranties</h2>
      <p>
        THE SITE AND ALL CONTENT ARE PROVIDED "AS IS" WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS
        OR IMPLIED. WE DISCLAIM ALL WARRANTIES, INCLUDING MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A
        PARTICULAR PURPOSE, AND NON-INFRINGEMENT. WE DO NOT WARRANT THAT THE SITE WILL BE
        UNINTERRUPTED, SECURE, OR ERROR-FREE.
      </p>

      <h2>Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>
        TO THE FULLEST EXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW, {SITE.name.toUpperCase()}, ITS AUTHORS,
        EDITORS, REVIEWERS, AND AFFILIATES SHALL NOT BE LIABLE FOR ANY DIRECT, INDIRECT,
        INCIDENTAL, CONSEQUENTIAL, OR SPECIAL DAMAGES ARISING FROM YOUR USE OF OR RELIANCE
        ON ANY CONTENT ON THIS SITE.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this disclaimer? Reach us at
        <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a> or through our
        <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>

<style>
  .page-hero {
    padding: var(--space-3xl) 0 var(--space-xl);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .hero-icon {
    font-size: 4rem;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .hero-meta {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
  }

  .legal-prose {
    padding-bottom: var(--space-4xl);
  }

  .legal-prose ul {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .legal-prose li {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
  }
</style>
